  "description": "Anthropic (Claude) bring-your-own-key adapter for Tamp.Conformance. A thin IChatCompletion shim over the Anthropic Messages API — the recommended default provider for ADR rule extraction and semantic conformance checks. Endpoint is overridable for Anthropic-compatible gateways; the key is read from the environment (or ~/.claude/credentials.json for local use) and never emitted.",
